Package: phymapr
Type: Package
Title: Phylogenetic Transmission Mapping and Animation
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Taylor Martins <taylor.martins@azdhs.gov>
Maintainer: Taylor Martins <taylor.martins@azdhs.gov>
Description: Generates end-to-end phylogenetic transmission pipelines by combining time-scaled phylogenetic trees with spatial metadata. Provides tools for data preparation, geographic coordinate snapping, ancestral state reconstruction, phylogenetic tree plotting, and generating animated spatial transmission maps.
